<component type="desktop-application">

  <id>io.github.city_of_memphis_wastewater.cellshift</id>

  <name>CellShift</name>

  <summary>Control Spreadsheet Data Migration In Standardized Forms.</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      CellShift is a tool for casting spreadsheets that experience cell address changes for known information. 
      XLSX based contract files change year to year at the City of Memphis Department of Public Works. For example, an existing 2025 contract spreadsheet can be easily cast to a 2026 contract spreadsheet using CellShift.
    </p>

    <p>
      The tool includes both a graphical interface and a CLI for automation.
    </p>
  </description>

